WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.520
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I&nbsp;
am going to explain an Australian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:15.920
science fiction thriller film called “I&nbsp;
Am Mother”. Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:23.040
The premise of the movie is set in a dystopian&nbsp;
future when human beings have gone extinct.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:29.520
Before their extinction, scientists had activated&nbsp;
a bunker as a backup plan to repopulate the earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:35.920
The bunker is run by an AI robot called Mother.&nbsp;
She is given the responsibility to sort through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:41.840
several human embryos and raise an efficient&nbsp;
human being who can be the guardian to upcoming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:48.400
generations. At the beginning of the movie, Mother&nbsp;
goes through sixty-three thousand human embryos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.960
and chooses a healthy one to raise. She places it&nbsp;
in the gestation chamber, an advanced device that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:01.280
develops an embryo into a baby in only twenty-four&nbsp;
hours. As she waits for the baby to develop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:06.880
in the artificial womb, gunshots are heard&nbsp;
outside the facility. She returns the next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:12.640
day and brings the newborn baby girl out of&nbsp;
the womb. The scene is followed by a montage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:18.560
of Mother raising the child. She watches Daughter&nbsp;
walking for the first time, nurtures her when she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:24.880
cries and loves her dearly. In their free time,&nbsp;
Daughter and Mother make origami together. Mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:28.960
even teaches her to dance, cook, and fight. 
When Daughter grows up to an appropriate age,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:34.880
Mother introduces her to the other embryos and&nbsp;
tells her about her purpose in the world. A few&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:41.360
more years later, Daughter turns into a teenager.&nbsp;
She often watches videos of humans on her tablet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:47.280
Although she is one of them, she is fascinated by&nbsp;
their nature. One day, when a technical problem&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:53.520
arises in Mother’s hand, she easily fixes it.&nbsp;
This makes Mother realise she has done a good job&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:59.760
raising Daughter. Everyday for an hour, Mother&nbsp;
teaches Daughter about morals and ethics. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:05.280
gives her hypothetical questions to test her&nbsp;
morality. Her primary aim is to familiarise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:10.960
Daughter with the concept of humanity. Soon, she&nbsp;
will have to attend a final test that will show&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:15.920
the efficiency of Mother’s upbringing. 
One night, Daughter has a hard time falling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:22.400
asleep so she watches videos of humans on her&nbsp;
tablet. Suddenly, the power cuts off. She goes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:28.400
outside looking for Mother and finds that she is&nbsp;
also out of power. She finds a broken cable to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:33.360
the cause of the power loss. As she brainstorms&nbsp;
what might have caused it, she hears a mouse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:39.200
squeaking. Daughter has never seen a live animal&nbsp;
before. She excitedly sets a mousetrap and fixes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:44.560
the cable. While waiting for the power to come&nbsp;
back, she catches the mouse and inspects it in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:50.800
fascination. After charging up, Mother finds her&nbsp;
with the animal and takes it away. The mouse’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:56.160
presence means a rupture in the airlock system of&nbsp;
the bunker which worries her. She claims that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.160 --> 00:03:05.840
air outside the bunker is highly toxic which&nbsp;
can kill humans instantly. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:12.000
she takes measures to ensure the air inside has&nbsp;
not been contaminated. Since the mouse is also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:17.760
a potential carrier of the contamination, she&nbsp;
incinerates it, against Daughter’s protests. 
&nbsp;

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:22.960
A few days later, they celebrate Daughter's&nbsp;
birthday. At dinner, a curious Daughter asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:28.480
Mother if humans can somehow survive outside&nbsp;
the bunker. The mouse’s existence has made her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:33.840
question mother’s teachings. Mother simply replies&nbsp;
that she knows there are no humans outside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:40.160
and since she has never been wrong, she declares&nbsp;
it a fact. Later that day, Daughter hears a noise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:45.120
coming from the airlock of the facility. She&nbsp;
goes near to check but doesn’t see anything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:51.200
from the first door. When the noise gets louder,&nbsp;
she puts on a hazmat suit and opens the door.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:57.600
As she moves closer to the second one, she hears&nbsp;
a human female yelling for help claiming that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:03.360
has gotten shot by a droid. Daughter quickly&nbsp;
gets a hazmat suit for the woman to help her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:09.200
She closes the first hatch to maintain a safe&nbsp;
distance, then opens the entrance, letting her in.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:15.200
When the door opens, Mother is alerted. The woman&nbsp;
begs her to not tell Mother about her arrival.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:20.880
Daughter is sceptical because she has never hidden&nbsp;
anything from her. Mother arrives but doesn’t see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:26.240
the injured woman as she stays hidden in&nbsp;
the airlock. When inquired what happened,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:30.960
Daughter claims that she accidentally opened&nbsp;
the entrance. As a punishment for her mistake,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:36.880
she is asked to take the final test right then.
Mother brings her to a classroom and gives her the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:42.240
tablet with the questions. After she leaves,&nbsp;
Daughter abandons the test and goes to see the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:47.840
woman. She finds her unconscious because of her&nbsp;
injury. She goes through her belongings just to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:53.920
be safe and finds a gun in it. She then wakes the&nbsp;
woman up and offers her water. As the woman opens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:59.840
her mask to drink it, Daughter protests about the&nbsp;
contamination. It is then revealed to her that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:05.840
there is no contamination in the outside world and&nbsp;
Mother has been lying to her this entire time. 
&nbsp;

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:10.800
Daughter hides the woman in a part of the&nbsp;
bunker before Mother can see them. She then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:15.680
goes to collect the required medicines from the&nbsp;
infirmary. In the meantime, Mother finds the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:21.600
poison mask in the airlock. The woman sees Mother&nbsp;
throwing her poison mask in the incinerator.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:25.680
Frightened, she checks for the gun&nbsp;
in her bag but doesn’t find it. 
&nbsp;

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:31.200
When Daughter returns, the woman sneaks up on her&nbsp;
and asks her about the gun. She refers to Mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:36.640
as a droid and wants the gun to protect herself&nbsp;
from her. Mother is surprised when she reaches the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:42.320
classroom and finds Daughter missing. She sees the&nbsp;
woman holding Daughter and sprints towards them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:47.360
The woman manages to shoot her once but the&nbsp;
bullet doesn’t do any harm. She grabs the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:52.720
woman and overpowers her easily. Daughter tries&nbsp;
stopping her, claiming that the only reason the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:57.760
woman is here is because she needs their help.&nbsp;
Mother understands the problem and takes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:03.040
injured woman to the infirmary. However, she&nbsp;
doesn’t allow Daughter to come in with her. 
&nbsp;

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:08.080
Following that, Mother interrogates the woman&nbsp;
while dressing her wounds but doesn’t get any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:13.520
answers. After she is done, she tells Daughter&nbsp;
that she lied to her about the contamination&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:18.640
to keep her safe from the dangers of the outside&nbsp;
world. Daughter doesn’t know what to think of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:24.000
revelation. Later that day, Daughter goes through&nbsp;
the woman’s belongings again and finds a book&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:29.280
with several sketches of people. She goes to the&nbsp;
woman and inquires about it. But the woman doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:34.960
say anything suspecting that Mother has sent her&nbsp;
to question her. When Daughter defends her Mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:39.120
the woman tells her that droids have&nbsp;
done horrible things to humans. 
&nbsp;

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:44.800
Later, Daughter apologises to Mother for letting&nbsp;
the woman in. Mother lovingly makes her understand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:50.320
the consequences and forgives her. The woman's&nbsp;
health gets worse but she doesn’t trust Mother to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:56.320
perform surgery on her. Hence, Daughter takes the&nbsp;
initiative and takes the bullet out successfully.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.320 --> 00:07:01.760
When the woman wakes up from the surgery, Daughter&nbsp;
gives her some food which she devours. The two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:06.400
talk as Mother watches them from afar. The&nbsp;
following day, the woman tells her that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:11.760
sketches in the book are her family members. She&nbsp;
asks Daughter to keep everything she is about to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:18.080
say a secret from Mother. She then tells her about&nbsp;
the survivors' camp in the mines where she was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:24.080
brought up. Daughter insists that the facility has&nbsp;
enough resources to help the people from the camp,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:29.760
so they should bring them here. However, the&nbsp;
woman instead wants Daughter to join them in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:35.280
the camp. Later, Mother informs Daughter that&nbsp;
the bullet she found from inside the woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:41.920
was identical to one from her gun. So, she&nbsp;
suspects her own kind had shot her. 
&nbsp;

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:47.200
Daughter then finally takes the test and&nbsp;
passes with flying colours. As a gift,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:53.840
Mother lets her pick any embryo to raise next.&nbsp;
The two patiently wait for the infant to be born.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:59.680
Later, the woman asks Daughter to check the&nbsp;
bullets herself and confirm who shot her, humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:05.760
or the droids. She does as said and finds out that&nbsp;
the bullets are completely different, meaning that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:12.320
Mother is lying to her yet again. While she is&nbsp;
at it, she also finds documents labelled for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:18.400
embryo number two. She goes through the files and&nbsp;
realises that she is not the first baby produced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:24.480
in the facility. Some of the other subjects are&nbsp;
labelled “failed”. She then checks the incinerator&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:30.960
to find the remains of a human jaw. She also&nbsp;
discovers a document that says the subject was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:37.520
aborted. Shocked that her Mother killed the other&nbsp;
babies, she no longer trusts her. She runs to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:42.720
woman and tells her about her findings. Daughter&nbsp;
then makes up her mind to run to the camp with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:48.560
the woman. However, she wants her brother to&nbsp;
be born first so she can take him as well. 
&nbsp;

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:54.560
The following day, Daughter collects supplies for&nbsp;
their escape but Mother catches her in the act.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.560 --> 00:09:00.000
Mother fools her by acting like she doesn’t know&nbsp;
about her plan and takes her to the kitchen. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:05.680
eventually locks her there and goes to the woman&nbsp;
to ask her about her true motive. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:10.880
Daughter manages to break the glass door by&nbsp;
spraying a chemical on it. The woman and Mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:15.520
get into a fight but Mother gets distracted&nbsp;
when Daughter sets off the fire alarm.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:20.240
The woman then finds Daughter and convinces&nbsp;
her to run away without her brother.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:25.520
When Mother tries to stop them, the woman grabs&nbsp;
Daughter hostage and threatens Mother to open&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:31.680
the door for them. Mother obliges as she doesn’t&nbsp;
want Daughter to get hurt. The two finally escape&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:37.280
and run outside. However, the barren land&nbsp;
and the bizarre reality of the outside world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:42.880
angers Daughter and she attacks the woman. The&nbsp;
woman insists they need to find cover as soon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:48.640
as possible and the two start to run again. 
They are followed by human killing droids and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:54.000
narrowly escape to get to their destination. The&nbsp;
woman informs Daughter that the droids harvested&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.000 --> 00:10:00.160
corn six months ago. Before that, humans could&nbsp;
hardly breathe. They reach a beach with massive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:05.440
cargo containers. At first, the Daughter is&nbsp;
mesmerized by the beauty of the sea but then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:11.280
she realizes the “camp” the woman was talking&nbsp;
about is the cargo containers. The woman finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:16.640
comes clean and says that the people at the camp&nbsp;
started getting crazy because of the lack of food,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:21.840
so she had fled from there years ago. The&nbsp;
Daughter is shocked and regrets coming with her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:27.680
Without thinking much about it, she flees back&nbsp;
to the facility again. However, at the entrance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:33.200
she encounters several droid guards who hold her&nbsp;
at gunpoint. When she mentions Mother, they let&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:38.560
her go inside without further questioning. 
Mother is glad she is safe and invites her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:44.080
come closer to look at her brother. When she&nbsp;
calms down, Mother finally explains to her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:50.320
the true purpose of her existence. It turns out&nbsp;
that before Daughter, she raised several humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:56.400
and let them free in the outside world. But she&nbsp;
failed to consider that they might turn evil and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.400 --> 00:11:01.760
fight among themselves. When her children started&nbsp;
to threaten the second extinction of humanity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:07.600
she took measures to stop them and appointed the&nbsp;
droids. Starting then, she decided to raise humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:11.920
who are ethical, like Daughter herself.&nbsp;
As the two look at the newborn lovingly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:16.880
Daughter asks her about the human remains she&nbsp;
had found. Before Mother can explain herself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:22.160
she holds the baby and tries to get away from&nbsp;
the facility by trapping Mother. The droids&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:27.920
outside get notified and start cutting through&nbsp;
the entrance door. Daughter points a gun at Mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:33.360
asking her to tell the other droids to retreat.&nbsp;
Mother explains that she and other droids share&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:39.200
the same vision and consciousness. She then tells&nbsp;
Daughter that she can either leave the facility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:45.600
without her brother or help her raise him. 
However, Daughter insists that Mother has already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:51.040
done her task by raising the Daughter. She wants a&nbsp;
chance to show her capabilities to her by raising&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:56.800
the child on her own. Suddenly, the droids stop&nbsp;
cutting through the entrance. Mother asks Daughter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:04.080
to disable her as she has fulfilled her purpose.&nbsp;
Daughter shoots at her CPU, finally killing her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:09.920
She takes on the responsibility to save humanity&nbsp;
from extinction. We then see the woman meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:14.960
a droid who looks just like mother. It tells&nbsp;
the woman that she has fulfilled her purpose,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:20.000
suggesting that she is also one of the mother’s&nbsp;
children who was presumably appointed to help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:25.360
her test Daughter’s potential. In the end,&nbsp;
Daughter is seen singing to her baby brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:29.680
and checking on other embryos.
